ot) and it was first introduced after the Battle of France in 1940 and used in service throughout the war.","LocalizedString":"The Schweres Wurfgerät 40 was a multiple rocket launcher used by the German Wehrmacth during WWII. 28 or 32 cm rockets could be fired from packing cases in the groups of four mounted on wooden or metal launch frames.The packing cases of the rockets could also be mounted on frames attached to the sides of Sd.Kfz. 251/1 half-tracks or various captured French vehicles, such as the Hotchkiss H35 tank. The Schweres Wurfgerät 40 was nicknamed Stuka-zu-Fuß (Stuka on foot) and it was first introduced after the Battle of France in 1940 and used in service throughout the war."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WinterWar","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Passive","extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Suppress","EHelpBubbleTypes::Fury"],"draftBaseWeight":0.85,"hasFury":true,"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'AU_Rocket_Art_Katyusha_fire_02'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Artillary/AU_Rocket_Art_Katyusha_fire_02.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Germany/CandidateArtwork/Winter_War/t_h39__28cm_swurfgerat_.t_h39__28cm_swurfgerat_","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Jarosław Wróbel","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/H39_sWG.H39_sWG","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":271.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_germany","Key":"card_unit_h39_swg_photo","SourceString":"Schweres Wurfgerät rocket launcher mounted on a captured French Hotchkiss H35 tank. Date unknown.","LocalizedString":"Schweres Wurfgerät rocket launcher mounted on a captured French Hotchkiss H35 tank. Date unknown."},"blowUpExplosionNiagara":{"ObjectName":"NiagaraSystem'NS_ExplosionArmourS'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Effects/Niagara/NS_ExplosionArmourS.31"},"blowUpCameraShake":{"ObjectName":"BlueprintGeneratedClass'CameraShakeLig